  "text": "\r\n\t Town of Gilford, NH Departments \r\nTown of Gilford, NH \nDepartments \nAssessing Office \nBuilding Inspector - Code Enforcement Officer \nFinance Department \nFire-Rescue \nGilford Police Department \nGilford Public Library \nHealth Officer \nParks & Recreation Department \nPlanning and Land Use Department \nPublic Works Department \nTown Administrator \nTown Clerk - Tax Collector \nWelfare Office \nBoards & Commissions \nBoard of Fire Engineers \nBoard of Selectmen \nBudget Committee \nCapital Improvements Planning Committee \nCemetery Trustees  \nConservation Commission \nEnergy Committee \nGunstock Acres Village Water District \nHistoric District & Heritage Commission \nKimball Wildlife Forest Committee \nLibrary Trustees \nNEW GILFORD PUBLIC WORKS FACILITY PROJECT \nOld Home Day Committee \nPlanning Board \nRecreation Commission \nSite Study \nSupervisors of the Checklist \nTrustees of Trust Funds \nZoning Board of Adjustment \nTown Information \nAgendas & Minutes \nNews & Notices \nFiles & Documents \nOrdinances and Regulations \nPage Files \nPost Files \nRequest for Proposals \nStaff \nLinks of Interest \nAbout the Town of Gilford \nLive Meeting Viewer \nSpecial Events \nCommunity Power \nOnline Payments \nContact \nShow Menu \r\nShowing all Departments \r\nAssessing Office \nPhone:  (603) 527-4704 \nFax:  (603) 527-4714 \n47 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, NH 03249 \nHours: Monday - Friday, 8:00AM to 4:30PM \nThe Assessing Office is responsible for determining the value of all properties (land & buildings) within the town for tax purposes. In addition, the Department administers statutory abatements and exemptions (e.g. Elderly Exemption, Veteran’s Credit, etc.) as approved by the Board of Selectmen.  \nBuilding Inspector - Code Enforcement Officer \nPhone:  (603) 527-4727 \nFax:  (603) 527-4731 \nEmail:  glane@gilfordnh.gov \nGeorge Lane III, Code Enforcement Officer & Health Officer \nJason Paltanavich, Deputy Code Enforcement Officer \n47 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, NH 03249 \nFinance Department \nPhone:  (603) 527-4701 \nFax:  (603) 527-4705 \nEmail:  finance@gilfordnh.gov \n47 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, NH 03249   \nHours:  Monday - Friday, 8:00AM to 4:30PM \nThe Finance Department is responsible for cash management, budgetary compliance, personnel and benefits, accounting processes, payroll, accounts payable and receivable, and the assessment of sewer capital cost, and betterment taxes.  \nFire-Rescue \nPhone:  (603) 527-4758 \nFax:  (603) 527-4763 \nEmail:  gilfordfirerescue@gilfordnh.gov \n39 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, NH 03249 \nThe Town of Gilford is serviced by 19 full-time Career members providing Fire-Rescue and Ambulance Services. \nGilford Police Department \nPhone:  (603) 527-4737 \nFax:  (603) 527-4749 \nEmail:  general@gilfordpd.gov \nEmergency Line: 603.528.3800 or 911 \n47 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, New Hampshire 03249 \nGilford Public Library \nPhone:  (603) 524-6042 \nFax:  (603) 524-1218 \nEmail:  gilfordlibrary@gmail.com \n31 Potter Hill Rd \nGilford, NH 03249 \nThe Gilford Public Library shall serve as a central cultural, educational and informational resource for the Gilford community by providing equal access to high quality books and multimedia materials, programs, exhibits, and online resources. To fulfill its mission, the Library employs a knowledgeable, well-trained staff committed to excellent service. \nTo visit their website go here:   http://www.gilfordlibrary.org \nHealth Officer \nPhone:  (603) 527-4727 \nFax:  (603) 527-4731 \nEmail:  glane@gilfordnh.org \nGeorge Lane III, Health Officer \n47 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, NH 03249 \nGilford’s Health Officer ensures public health standards are met throughout the town. \nParks & Recreation Department \nPhone:  (603) 527-4722 \nFax:  (603) 527-6500 \nEmail:  mmansur@gilfordnh.gov \n47 Cherry Valley Road   \nGilford, NH 03249 \nProgram Announcement Line: (603) 527-4723 \nThe Gilford Parks and Recreation Department constantly strives to provide and maintain high quality, year-round programs, activities, and facilities for people of all ages and abilities.  \nPlanning and Land Use Department \nPhone:  (603) 527-4727 \nFax:  (603) 527-4731 \n47 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, NH 03249 \nHours: Monday - Friday, 8:00AM to 4:30PM \nThe Gilford Department of Planning and Land Use (DPLU) provides services to the community for building permits and inspections, planning and zoning, code enforcement, and public health.  \nPublic Works Department \nPhone:  (603) 527-4778 \nFax:  (603) 527-4781 \nEmail:  dpwdirector@gilfordnh.gov \n55 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, NH 03249 \nHours: Monday - Friday,  7:30AM - 4:00PM \nThe Public Works Department, with its different divisions, has a workforce of 25 full time employees.  It includes the Highway Division, Maintenance Division, Buildings and Grounds Division, Sewer Division, Recycle Center and Solid Waste Division.  \nTown Administrator \nPhone:  (603) 527-4700 \nFax:  (603) 527-4711 \n47 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, NH 03249 \nHours: Monday - Friday, 8:00AM to 5:00PM \nGilford's Town Administrator's duties and responsibilities are determined by the Board of Selectmen. This position frequently prepares information statements that serve as the basis for many policy decisions made by the Selectmen. The position may also include such assignments as project researcher, grant writer, organizer, advisor, public relations officer, as well as Administrator. \nTown Clerk - Tax Collector \nPhone:  (603) 527-4713 \nFax:  (603) 527-4719 \nEmail:  dlafond@gilfordnh.gov \nDanielle LaFond \n47 Cherry Valley Road \nGilford, NH 03249 \nHours:  Monday - Wednesday & Friday - 8:00AM to 4:30PM \n          Thursday - 8:00AM to 6:00PM \nThe Town Clerk is responsible for the registration, recording and management of all vital events and records occurring in the Town of Gilford. \nWelfare Office \nPhone:  (603) 527-4796 \nFax:  (603) 527-4705 \nEmail:  welfare@gilfordnh.gov \nTom Carr \nWelfare Director \nOffice Hours: Please call for appointment \nThe Welfare Officer provides assistance to Gilford residents in need. \r\n\t\t\t\t  Home \r\n\t\t\t\t  Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t\t  News & Notices \r\n\t\t\t\t  Files & Forms \r\n\t\t\t\t  Town Calendar \r\n\t\t\t\t  Departments \r\n\t\t\t\t  Boards & Committees \r\n\t\t\t\t  Find it Fast \r\n\t\t\t\t  Search \r\nTown of Gilford, NH \n47 Cherry Valley Rd.\r\nGilford, NH 03249 \n(603) 527-4700 \nHome \nDepartments \nBoards & Commissions \nTown Information \nOnline Transactions \nContact \nCopyright© 2026 Town of Gilford, NH. All rights reserved.\r\nWebsite by  Legend Software \r\n ",
